# Research on Humanities Information and Communication in Britain.

**Authors:** Sturges, Paul

## Abstract
Discussion of humanities research focuses on activities of the British Library Research and Development Department (BLRDD), particularly the Humanities Information Review Panel. The influence of technology on humanities research is considered, including word processing, greater availability of computer networks, and the online public access catalog (OPAC) in academic libraries. (43 references) (LRW)

